[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8580.11, "timestamp": "02:23:00", "text": "得到？什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8584.49, "timestamp": "02:23:04", "text": "什么？等等，我刚刚意识到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8586.27, "timestamp": "02:23:06", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8591.19, "timestamp": "02:23:11", "text": "等等，什么？我经历了这么多之后，居然没发现？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8592.67, "timestamp": "02:23:12", "text": "多年来我一直如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8604.469, "timestamp": "02:23:24", "text": "甚至连他的年龄都搞错了，就像他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8607.75, "timestamp": "02:23:27", "text": "第一个时代。等等，他的年龄"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8610.07, "timestamp": "02:23:30", "text": "错了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8612.63, "timestamp": "02:23:32", "text": "是的，他不是25岁。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8616.309, "timestamp": "02:23:36", "text": "我的天哪，不要。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8618.63, "timestamp": "02:23:38", "text": "或者，如果你用的是第 27 条的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8624.07, "timestamp": "02:23:44", "text": "哦，等等。那样的话，现在就是28了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8634.79, "timestamp": "02:23:54", "text": "不用担心。如有疑问，请轻拍"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8637.429, "timestamp": "02:23:57", "text": "香蕉。"}]